2, +0.062 to +0.462) is suggestive but not threshold-cleared and is deferred. Conditioning on absence of other predictors or quality strata is descriptive stratification, not causal adjustment, and can induce selection or composition differences; all conclusions are descriptive associations in the supplied dataset, not causality, single-gene knockout mechanism, or external generalizability.",
  "research_notes": "Iteration 15 appraise update: accept clean low-Cas9 PTEN H230, clean low-screen PTEN H231, broad low-screen PTEN H196, clean high-Cas9 KEAP1 H236, clean high-Cas9 SMARCA4 H238, and stringent high-screen/high-Cas9 SMARCA4 H221. Keep clean high-Cas9 PTEN H229 unresolved active because the interval lower bound is +0.065; defer clean high-Cas9 TP53 H237 and low-Cas9 PTEN interaction H233; reject PTEN high-Cas9/high-screen/low-screen interactions H232/H234/H235 as not threshold-supported. Main conclusion: KEAP1, SMARCA4, MSI-high, and broad TP53 effects persist in several stringent contexts, PTEN is accepted in low-Cas9/low-screen clean contexts but not established in the clean high-Cas9 main effect, and no interaction is established. No independent validation capacity remains; active PTEN contrasts should be interpreted cautiously and cannot be treated as independent replications."
