xts such as serum level, matched RNA/DNA omics availability, Avana library, and batch_a versus batch_b. CDKN2A and the constructed research markers/signatures remain unsupported. All conclusions are descriptive associations in this dataset, not causation, single-gene knockout mechanism, biological mechanism, or external generalizability.",
